Cmplt guard folds the edge guard it proves: true
without the guard the same edge guard survives: true
a guard weaker than the loop range narrows nothing: true
Cmple guard folds the edge guard it proves: true
a Cmple guard at the loop's top narrows nothing: true
Cmpeq guard folds the edge guard it proves: true
Cmpne guard narrows nothing: true
And guard narrows both conjuncts' symbols: true
only one conjunct's narrowing does not decide it: true
Or guard narrows nothing: true
a lower-bound guard folds a refuted edge guard to its else-branch: true
without it the same edge guard survives: true
an inner guard implied by the outer one is erased: true
a data-dependent guard narrows nothing: true
an unsatisfiable conjunction is left alone: true
a float-precision guard past its exact-integer range narrows nothing: true
the same guard at the index precision narrows: true
